 integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{[{e}^{x+y}]}_{0}^{1}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}({e}^{1+y}-{e}^{0+y})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}({e}^{1+y}-{e}^{y})\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(e{e}^{y}-{e}^{y})\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{e}^{y}(e-1)\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{e}^{y}(e-1)\\text{d}y & =(e-1)[{e}^{y}]_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =(e-1)({e}^{2}-{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =(e-1)({e}^{2}-1) \\\\  & ={e}^{3}-{e}^{2}-e+1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328343 13194139535039 true] [17592186328342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328344 13194139535039 true] [17592186328342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328345 13194139535039 true] [17592186328342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328346 13194139535039 true] [17592186328342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328347 13194139535039 true] [17592186328342 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535039 true] [17592186328342 1041 "selection" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328342 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328344 13194139535039 true] [17592186328342 1110 #uuid "5f30f112-94db-5290-8ef2-bd50992d56cc" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328343 1034 "{e}^{3}-{e}^{2}+e-1" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328343 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535039 true] [17592186328343 1111 #uuid "a68f8bc5-7807-577b-86fd-c9f7ef986aae" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328344 1034 "{e}^{3}-{e}^{2}-e+1" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328344 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535039 true] [17592186328344 1111 #uuid "3aa4efda-8a77-5084-89df-bcfb29035295" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328345 1034 "{e}^{3}+{e}^{2}+e+1" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328345 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535039 true] [17592186328345 1111 #uuid "5bc1a623-857c-53ad-a2db-9d1d6b81fd80" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328346 1034 "{e}^{3}+{e}^{2}-e-1" 1