9 true] [17592186328355 1100 "Evaluate the repeated integral\n${\\int }_{0}^{1/2}{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y.$" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328355 1113 #uuid "5d75c934-4b2e-5a66-8cae-88fc5a6df561" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328355 1145 "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}[{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}[{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}{[-\\frac{1}{x}]}_{1}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}(-\\frac{1}{2}-(-1))\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}\\text{d}y & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡y]_{0}^{1/2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{\\pi }{6}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{12}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328356 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328357 13194139535039 true] [17592186328356 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328358 13194139535039 true] [17592186328356 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328359 13194139535039 true] [17592186328356 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328360 13194139535039 true] [17592186328356 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328361 13194139535039 true] [17592186328356 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535039 true] [17592186328356 1041 "selection" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328356 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328358 13194139535039 true] [17592186328356 1110 #uuid "1a122284-d8dd-5afb-9e25-bbe993f43898" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328357 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328357 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535039 true] [175921863283