68 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{6}" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328368 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535039 true] [17592186328368 1111 #uuid "02b37091-4db1-5ec6-bc07-80cfa2dc04b0" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328369 1017 #edb/ref 17592186328370 13194139535039 true] [17592186328369 1089 "q-73591" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328369 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535039 true] [17592186328369 1100 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}\\frac{{y}^{2}}{x}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,{e}^{2}\\le x\\le {e}^{4},\\,0\\le y\\le \\sqrt[3]{6}}.$" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328369 1113 #uuid "84e85edf-4c2e-5a0c-ab98-f77929dd94e4" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328369 1145 "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:      \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\frac{{y}^{2}}{x}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{6}}[{\\int }_{{e}^{2}}^{{e}^{4}}\\frac{{y}^{2}}{x}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{6}}[{\\int }_{{e}^{2}}^{{e}^{4}}\\frac{{y}^{2}}{x}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{6}}{y}^{2}[{\\int }_{{e}^{2}}^{{e}^{4}}\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{6}}{y}^{2}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡x]_{{e}^{2}}^{{e}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{6}}{y}^{2}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡{e}^{4}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡{e}^{2})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{6}}{y}^{2}\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{6}}2{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{6}}2{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\frac{2}{3}[{y}^{3}]_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{6}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}((\\sqrt[3]{6})^{3}-{0}^{3}) \\\\  & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328371 13194139535039 true] [17592186328370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328372 131941