rating with respect to $y$, treating $x$ as a constant:    \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{{e}^{-1}}^{{e}^{3}}\\frac{{3}^{x}}{y}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{3}^{x}[{\\int }_{{e}^{-1}}^{{e}^{3}}\\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{3}^{x}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡y]_{{e}^{-1}}^{{e}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{3}^{x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡{e}^{3}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡{e}^{-1})\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{3}^{x}(3+1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}4\\cdot {3}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}4\\cdot {3}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =4{[\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =4(\\frac{{3}^{1}-{3}^{0}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328378 13194139535039 true] [17592186328377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328379 13194139535039 true] [17592186328377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328380 13194139535039 true] [17592186328377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328381 13194139535039 true] [17592186328377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328382 13194139535039 true] [17592186328377 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535039 true] [17592186328377 1041 "selection" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328377 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328378 13194139535039 true] [17592186328377 1110 #uuid "42b4ebdd-4a5c-579a-8412-a14370d6b40a" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328378 1034 "\\frac{8}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328378 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535039 true] [17592186328378 1111 #uuid "c794778d-d6a8-5ca4-b34b-99a57dec5677" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328379 1034 "\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328379 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535039 true] [17592186328379 1111 #uuid "c84cf251-b895-5499-9ab1-deaba449235c" 13194139535039 true] [17592186328380 1034 "8\\operatorname{ln}⁡3" 13194139535039